Vendored from https://github.com/LeoRover/leo_simulator-ros2 (leo_gz_worlds package),
model "Marsyard 2022 terrain" by Mars Society Polska.

The diffuse texture (marsyard2022_terrain_texture.jpg) was re-encoded from the
upstream 6000x6000 PNG to a 2048x2048 JPEG to reduce its size in this repo.
All other files are unmodified copies of the upstream originals.

